        "original_id": "06c3121c-bfd3-5472-8fcb-c1271cc8810d",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Tommy Swerdlow, Willard Huyck, Chip Zien, Lea Thompson, Jeffrey Jones, Tim Robbins\n- Products: Howard the Duck, Spaceballs, Cool Runnings, Little Giants, Snow Dogs, A Thousand Junkies\n- Roles: actor, screenwriter, director\n- Topics: American film\n\nFacts:\n- Tommy Swerdlow is an American actor and screenwriter.\n- Howard the Duck is a 1986 American science-fiction comedy film, titled Howard: A New Breed of Hero in the UK.\n- Howard the Duck was directed by Willard Huyck and starred Chip Zien, Lea Thompson, Jeffrey Jones, and Tim Robbins.\n- Tommy Swerdlow appeared in Howard the Duck in 1986 and Spaceballs in 1987.\n- Tommy Swerdlow co-wrote the screenplays for Cool Runnings in 1993, Little Giants in 1994, and Snow Dogs in 2002.\n- A Thousand Junkies is a 2017 American comedy-drama film directed by and starring Tommy Swerdlow.",
